      ],
      "blocks": {
        "text_mRz8Ek": {
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>INTRODUCING THE DENIM COLLECTION</strong></p><p>Handcrafted in Japan by skilled artisans, we use the highest quality Japanese denim and time-honored techniques, upholding responsible manufacturing methods that honor both people and the environment. Each piece is meticulously crafted, undergoing nearly 100 steps to produce one garment.</p><p>All of our denim is 100% cotton, with thoughtful touches, like contrast topstitching, hand-tacked embroidery instead of rivets to optimize softness, and adjustable waistbands and straps for long-wear and the perfect fit.</p><p>Designed for comfort and made for long wear — this denim can be worn often, worn in, and passed down.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          },
          "type": "text"
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "",
        "content_layout": "no-overlap",
